{"seq":1,"slug":"biome-overview","title":"Biome 全面解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/biome-overview","wordCount":931,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"biome-全面解析\">Biome 全面解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Biome 是一个用 Rust 编写的高性能 Web 工具链，目标是将格式化（Formatter）、静态分析（Linter）、导入排序（Import Organizer）统一到一个工具中。它继承了 Rome 项目的愿景，通过<strong>单一二进制文件</strong>替代 Prettier + ESLint 的组合方案，在保持高度兼容性的同时获得数量级的性能提升。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Biome 统一入口]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Rust 解析器]&#10;    C --&gt; D[CST 具象语法树]&#10;    D --&gt; E[格式化引擎]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Lint 分析引擎]&#10;    D --&gt; G[导入排序引擎]&#10;    E --&gt; H[格式化输出]&#10;    F --&gt; I[诊断报告]&#10;    G --&gt; J[排序后导入]\">flowchart TD\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Biome 统一入口]\n    B --&gt; C[Rust 解析器]\n    C --&gt; D[CST 具象语法树]\n    D --&gt; E[格式化引擎]\n    D --&gt; F[Lint 分析引擎]\n    D --&gt; G[导入排序引擎]\n    E --&gt; H[格式化输出]\n    F --&gt; I[诊断报告]\n    G --&gt; J[排序后导入]</pre><p>Biome 与传统工具链的核心差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Prettier + ESLint</th>\n<th>Biome</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现语言</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具数量</td>\n<td>2+ 个独立工具</td>\n<td>1 个统一工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置文件</td>\n<td>.prettierrc + eslint.config</td>\n<td>biome.json</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析次数</td>\n<td>每个工具各解析一次</td>\n<td>单次解析，多功能复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>快 10-100 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式化兼容</td>\n<td>Prettier 自身</td>\n<td>~97% Prettier 兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lint 规则数</td>\n<td>ESLint 数百条 + 插件</td>\n<td>~300+ 条（持续增长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装体积</td>\n<td>~100MB+ (node_modules)</td>\n<td>~10MB 单二进制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Biome 的核心优势不仅是性能，更是<strong>工具链简化</strong>——减少配置文件数量、消除工具间的版本冲突、统一诊断输出格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构与解析器设计\">架构与解析器设计</h2><p>Biome 的内部架构围绕 <strong>CST（Concrete Syntax Tree，具象语法树）</strong> 构建。与 ESLint 使用的 AST 不同，CST 保留了源代码中的所有信息，包括空白、注释、括号等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BiomeArchitecture {&#10;  parser: {&#10;    type: &#39;CST-based&#39;;&#10;    languages: [&#39;JavaScript&#39;, &#39;TypeScript&#39;, &#39;JSX&#39;, &#39;TSX&#39;, &#39;JSON&#39;, &#39;CSS&#39;];&#10;    errorRecovery: &#39;容错解析，语法错误不阻断&#39;;&#10;    incrementalParsing: &#39;支持增量更新&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  formatter: {&#10;    algorithm: &#39;IR-based (类似 Prettier Doc)&#39;;&#10;    compatibility: &#39;97% Prettier 输出兼容&#39;;&#10;    performance: &#39;并行文件处理&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  linter: {&#10;    rules: &#39;300+ 内置规则&#39;;&#10;    categories: [&#39;correctness&#39;, &#39;suspicious&#39;, &#39;style&#39;, &#39;complexity&#39;, &#39;a11y&#39;];&#10;    autofix: &#39;安全修复 + 不安全修复分离&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BiomeArchitecture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CST-based'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    languages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JavaScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JSX'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TSX'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JSON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CSS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    errorRecovery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '容错解析，语法错误不阻断'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    incrementalParsing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '支持增量更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  formatter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    algorithm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'IR-based (类似 Prettier Doc)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    compatibility</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '97% Prettier 输出兼容'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    performance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '并行文件处理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  linter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '300+ 内置规则'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    categories</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'correctness'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'suspicious'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'style'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'complexity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'a11y'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    autofix</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '安全修复 + 不安全修复分离'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CST 的优势在于它是<strong>可逆的</strong>——从 CST 可以精确重建原始源代码。这对格式化工具尤为重要，因为它需要在修改空白的同时保留注释等非语法信息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B{解析}&#10;    B --&gt; C[CST 具象语法树]&#10;    C --&gt; D[保留空白和注释]&#10;    C --&gt; E[语法节点完整]&#10;    C --&gt; F[位置信息精确]&#10;    D --&gt; G[格式化可逆]&#10;    E --&gt; H[Lint 分析精确]&#10;    F --&gt; I[错误定位准确]\">flowchart LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B{解析}\n    B --&gt; C[CST 具象语法树]\n    C --&gt; D[保留空白和注释]\n    C --&gt; E[语法节点完整]\n    C --&gt; F[位置信息精确]\n    D --&gt; G[格式化可逆]\n    E --&gt; H[Lint 分析精确]\n    F --&gt; I[错误定位准确]</pre><p>Biome 的解析器支持<strong>容错解析</strong>——即使代码存在语法错误，解析器仍然会尽力构建部分 CST，使得 lint 和格式化可以在有语法错误的文件上工作。这在编辑器实时检查场景中尤为重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置与规则体系\">配置与规则体系</h2><p>Biome 使用 <code>biome.json</code> 作为唯一的配置文件，结构清晰地分为格式化、lint、导入排序三个部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://biomejs.dev/schemas/1.9.0/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;organizeImports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;indentStyle&quot;: &quot;space&quot;,&#10;    &quot;indentWidth&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;lineWidth&quot;: 80,&#10;    &quot;lineEnding&quot;: &quot;lf&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;linter&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;rules&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;recommended&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;correctness&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;noUnusedVariables&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;        &quot;noUnusedImports&quot;: &quot;error&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;suspicious&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;noExplicitAny&quot;: &quot;warn&quot;,&#10;        &quot;noDoubleEquals&quot;: &quot;error&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;style&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;useConst&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;        &quot;noNonNullAssertion&quot;: &quot;warn&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;complexity&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;noBannedTypes&quot;: &quot;error&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;javascript&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;formatter&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;quoteStyle&quot;: &quot;double&quot;,&#10;      &quot;trailingCommas&quot;: &quot;all&quot;,&#10;      &quot;semicolons&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,&#10;      &quot;arrowParentheses&quot;: &quot;always&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://biomejs.dev/schemas/1.9.0/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"organizeImports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"formatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indentStyle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"space\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indentWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lineEnding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lf\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recommended\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"correctness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noUnusedVariables\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noUnusedImports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"suspicious\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noExplicitAny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"noDoubleEquals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</s