e=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"trailingCommas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"semicolons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"arrowParentheses\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"always\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Biome 的规则分类体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>correctness</td>\n<td>代码正确性</td>\n<td>noUnusedVariables, noUndeclaredVariables</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>suspicious</td>\n<td>可疑代码模式</td>\n<td>noExplicitAny, noDoubleEquals</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>style</td>\n<td>代码风格</td>\n<td>useConst, useTemplate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>complexity</td>\n<td>代码复杂度</td>\n<td>noBannedTypes, noForEach</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>a11y</td>\n<td>无障碍访问</td>\n<td>useAltText, useAriaProps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>security</td>\n<td>安全相关</td>\n<td>noDangerouslySetInnerHTML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nursery</td>\n<td>实验性规则</td>\n<td>新规则的孵化区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Biome 支持文件级覆盖，类似 ESLint 的 files/ignores 模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;overrides&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;**/*.test.ts&quot;, &quot;**/*.spec.ts&quot;],&#10;      &quot;linter&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;rules&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;suspicious&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;noExplicitAny&quot;: &quot;off&quot;&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;scripts/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;linter&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;rules&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;style&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;noConsole&quot;: &quot;off&quot;&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"overrides\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"**/*.test.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"**/*.spec.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"linter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"suspicious\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"noExplicitAny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"off\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scripts/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"linter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"noConsole\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"off\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-prettier-和-eslint-的兼容策略\">与 Prettier 和 ESLint 的兼容策略</h2><p>Biome 的采用策略是<strong>渐进式替代</strong>——先作为 Prettier 的替代品（格式化兼容度最高），再逐步替代 ESLint 的规则。</p>\n<p>格式化兼容性方面，Biome 通过一个专门的兼容性测试套件追踪与 Prettier 的输出差异。少数已知差异是有意为之的改进：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const knownDifferences = {&#10;  trailingCommaInArrowParams: &#39;Biome 在单参数箭头函数中不添加括号时更一致&#39;,&#10;  htmlAttributeFormatting: &#39;HTML 属性换行策略有微小差异&#39;,&#10;  markdownTableAlignment: &#39;Markdown 表格对齐策略不同&#39;,&#10;  jsonTrailingComma: &#39;JSON 中永远不添加尾逗号（标准合规）&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> knownDifferences</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trailingCommaInArrowParams: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Biome 在单参数箭头函数中不添加括号时更一致'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  htmlAttributeFormatting: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HTML 属性换行策略有微小差异'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  markdownTableAlignment: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Markdown 表格对齐策略不同'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jsonTrailingComma: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JSON 中永远不添加尾逗号（标准合规）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从 Prettier 迁移的配置映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Prettier 选项</th>\n<th>Biome 等价配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>printWidth: 80</td>\n<td>formatter.lineWidth: 80</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tabWidth: 2</td>\n<td>formatter.indentWidth: 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>useTabs: false</td>\n<td>formatter.indentStyle: &quot;space&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>semi: true</td>\n<td>javascript.formatter.semicolons: &quot;always&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>singleQuote: false</td>\n<td>javascript.formatter.quoteStyle: &quot;double&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trailingComma: &quot;all&quot;</td>\n<td>javascript.formatter.trailingCommas: &quot;all&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>arrowParens: &quot;always&quot;</td>\n<td>javascript.formatter.arrowParentheses: &quot;always&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Biome 提供了 <code>biome migrate prettier</code> 命令自动从 <code>.prettierrc</code> 生成 <code>biome.json</code> 的格式化配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编辑器集成与-cli\">编辑器集成与 CLI</h2><p>Biome 提供了 VS Code 扩展和 CLI 两种使用方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"biome check .                    # 格式化 + lint + 导入排序（仅检查）&#10;biome check --write .            # 格式化 + lint + 导入排序（自动修复）&#10;biome format --write .           # 仅格式化&#10;biome lint .                     # 仅 lint&#10;biome ci .                       # CI 模式（严格检查，不修复）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 格式化 + lint + 导入排序（仅检查）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 格式化 + lint + 导入排序（自动修复）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 仅格式化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                     # 仅 lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biome</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ci</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                       # CI 模式（严格检查，不修复）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>VS Code 集成配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;editor.defaultFormatter&quot;: &quot;biomejs.biome&quot;,&#10;  &quot;editor.formatOnSave&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;editor.codeActionsOnSave&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;quickfix.biome&quot;: &quot;explicit&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source.organizeImports.biome&quot;: &quot;explicit&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"editor.defaultFormatter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"biomejs.biome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"editor.formatOnSave\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"editor.codeActionsOnSave\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quickfix.biome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explicit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source.organizeImports.biome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explicit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Biome 的 CLI 设计注重<strong>单命令覆盖所有功能</strong>。<code>biome check</code> 是最常用的命令，它同时执行格式化检查、lint、和导入排序，一次性报告所有问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;biome check --write&quot;] --&gt; B[解析所有文件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[格式化引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Lint 引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; E[导入排序引擎]&#10;    C --&gt; F{有格式问题?}&#10;    D --&gt; G{有 Lint 问题?}&#10;    E --&gt; H{需要排序?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| I[写入格式化后文件]&#10;    G --&gt;|安全修复| J[应用自动修复]&#10;    G --&gt;|不安全修复| K[仅报告]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| L[写入排序后导入]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"biome check --write\"] --&gt; B[解析所有文件]\n    B --&gt; C[格式化引擎]\n    B --&gt; D[Lint 引擎]\n    B --&gt; E[导入排序引擎]\n    C --&gt; F{有格式问题?}\n    D --&gt; G{有 Lint 问题?}\n    E --&gt; H{需要排序?}\n    F --&gt;|是| I[写入格式化后文件]\n    G --&gt;|安全修复| J[应用自动修复]\n    G --&gt;|不安全修复| K[仅报告]\n    H --&gt;|是| L[写入排序后导入]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Biome))&#10;    核心优势&#10;      Rust 高性能&#10;      单一二进制&#10;      统一工具链&#10;    架构&#10;      CST 具象语法树&#10;      容错解析&#10;      单次解析多功能&#10;    配置&#10;      biome.json&#10;      规则分类体系&#10;      文件级覆盖&#10;    兼容性&#10;      97% Prettier 兼容&#10;      渐进式替代&#10;      迁移命令&#10;    集成&#10;      VS Code 扩展&#10;      CLI 单命令&#10;      CI 模式\">mindmap\n  root((Biome))\n    核心优势\n      Rust 高性能\n      单一二进制\n      统一工具链\n    架构\n      CST 具象语法树\n      容错解析\n      单次解析多功能\n    配置\n      biome.json\n      规则分类体系\n      文件级覆盖\n    兼容性\n      97% Prettier 兼容\n      渐进式替代\n      迁移命令\n    集成\n      VS Code 扩展\n      CLI 单命令\n      CI 模式</pre><ul>\n<li>Biome 通过 Rust 实现将格式化 + lint + 导入排序统一为单一工具，性能提升 10-100 倍</li>\n<li>CST 架构保留源代码所有信息，支持容错解析和精确的格式化/lint 分析</li>\n<li>规则分类为 correctness/suspicious/style/complexity/a11y/security 六大类别</li>\n<li>与 Prettier 保持 97% 的格式化输出兼容，提供自动迁移命令</li>\n<li><code>biome check</code> 单命令覆盖所有检查，<code>--write</code> 标志控制是否自动修复</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Biome 全面解析","id":"biome-全面解析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构与解析器设计","id":"架构与解析器设计"},{"level":2,"text":"配置与规则体系","id":"配置与规则体系"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Prettier 和 ESLint 的兼容策略","id":"与-prettier-和-eslint-的兼容策略"},{"level":2,"text":"编辑器集成与 CLI","id":"编辑器集成与-cli"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ESLint Flat Config 迁移与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth/eslint-flat-config"},"next":{"title":"OXC 与 oxlint 概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/oxlint-overview"}}